## Chapter 3 Strangeness Production in STAR

### 3.1 Dataset

The data we have used is from run12 of STAR experiment at RHIC for U+U collisions at \(\sqrt{s_{NN}}\) = 193 GeV using minimum bias trigger. Minimum bias trigger requires co-incidence of signals from VPD, ZDC and/or BBC. Protected trigger assures from pile-up events. Bad runs are removed as mentioned in Ref. [1].

The dataset information is listed in Table 3.1.

