### 3.6 Raw Spectra

By following method as described in Section 3.5.2 for all \(p_{T}\) and centrality window, we can count number of signal tracks. Raw spectra of a track is obtained after normalising this yield, over number of events & other variables over which the counting is done (viz \(p_{T}\), rapidity, bin width).

